        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Samsung Adopts the Same Silicon Photonics Development Partners as TSMC  Samsung Electronics has been found to have selected the same development partners as Taiwan's TSMC for silicon photonics, a technology that uses light to reduce semiconductor bottlenecks, heat, and power",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2096908177271033916",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-07T18:27:22.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 266
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "DIGITIMES' latest report on Intel:  Intel will raise prices on PC CPUs by another 10% in October.  At the same time, the Small Core product line, which carries lower gross margins, may be headed toward EOL (End of Life).  This would open an opportunity for Qualcomm and MediaTek",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2097098974209675740",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-08T07:05:32.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 180
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "AWS 擴大拉貨 AI 機櫃，台積電、世芯、緯穎、鴻海本季出貨轉強。  客戶動向 亞馬遜資本支出上修至 2,200 億美元，主攻 AI 基建。亞馬遜執行長賈西（Andy Jassy）看好算力吃緊延續至 2027–2028 年；AWS AI 與自研晶片規模約 250 億美元，仍高速成長。  晶片與製程 Annapurna 自研 ASIC 多由台積電 3",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2096839128268853648",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-07T13:53:00.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 95
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "三星晶圓代工正全力擴產 HBM4。4奈米製程已有逾半產能投入 HBM4 基底晶片（base die），近期占比達50%～60%，下半年將維持高水位。此舉旨在提前因應下半年對輝達、博通、超微等大廠的供應擴大。  三星今年2月率先量產出貨",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2096885980452327821",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-07T16:59:10.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 86
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Taiwan’s top 5 semiconductor fab and fab systems builders are seeing the strongest capacity expansion in history, with a combined order backlog over NT$880 billion (US$27.8B) and visibility through 2027, media report, mainly for key clients TSMC and Micron. The backlog could hit",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2096764475508752649",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-07T08:56:21.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 76
        },
        {
          "handle": "dnystedt",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Intel plans to raise CPU prices another 10% in early October, the latest of several price increases since late 2025 due to strong demand and rising costs, DigiTimes reports, adding the New Intel also plans to kill off low-margin “small core” CPU products as its shrinks its",
          "url": "https://x.com/dnystedt/status/2097115815430779278",
          "timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:12:27.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 35
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "英特爾( Intel )傳2026年10月5日左右再調漲PC CPU約10%，延續2025年底以來多次漲價。低毛利Small Core產品線可能EOL，策略改為拉高毛利率，不再殺價搶市佔。執行長陳立武同步精簡組織，管理層從12層降至6層，員工約7.5萬人。",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2097117613243695486",
